  "title": "RTPS: Fix Topic Information display in APP_ACK submessage",
  "description": "APP_ACK sets guid->entity_id but was missing the\nguid->fields_present |= GUID_HAS_ENTITY_ID assignment, causing\nrtps_util_get_topic_info to skip the registry lookup. This prevented\ntopic name and type from appearing in the dissection tree and the\n\"-> <topic>\" annotation in the Info column.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
